    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "3. An FIR was lodged on 07.03.2022, under Sections 498A, 304B I.P.C. and Section 3/4 Dowry Prohibition Act against the revisionist and four others.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 984,
